#### 10. Ignored / Disabled Test — `disabledTest()` (line 109)

```java
@Disabled("flaky, fix later")
void disabledTest() { ... }
```

The annotation says "fix later" with no tracking reference. Disabled tests accumulate and are rarely revisited.

**Refactor — either fix the flakiness and re-enable, or delete and track re-implementation in a ticket:**

```java
@Disabled("Tracked in JIRA-1234 — flaky due to ...")
```

**Risk if unfixed:** Dead code; false sense of coverage.

